<!--
  Entitlements the release workflow signs the app with (hardened runtime, which
  notarization requires). The set is deliberately empty: a Go binary needs no
  JIT or unsigned-memory exception, and the web content runs in WebKit's own
  processes. Add a key only when a notarized build is shown to need it, with the
  reason next to it.
-->
